abstract: >
  This software provides the implementation of the Explainable Women's
  Mental Health and Empowerment Assessment (X-WMHEA) model for psychosocial
  assessment of women's mental health and empowerment. The implementation
  includes psychosocial data preprocessing, HSIC-LASSO feature selection,
  TabM-based classification, Adan optimization, and SHAP-based explainability
  analysis.
